entry='<section class="entry-section" id="start-building"><p class="eyebrow">THE DEVELOPER TOOLKIT</p><h2 class="entry-title">Make the next step real.<br><i>Keep a way back.</i></h2><p>Start with the local SDK, inspect its source, and try a complete correction-and-recovery path. Then connect the right owner services in your own application. Private work stays private.</p><div class="doc-grid">'+card('Start building.','Download the local source preview and run a working example.','/docs/quickstart.html','SOURCE + TYPES')+card('Try a complete return.','Make a record, correct it, export it, and restore its history.','/playground.html','WORKING EXAMPLE')+card('Human Stewardship.','Read the source-backed principles and the human review method.','/docs/human-stewardship.html','OFFICIAL DOCUMENTATION')+'</div><p class="release-note">Current release: '+V+'. <a href="/docs/status.html">Named capabilities, integration boundaries, and remaining release gates.</a></p></section>'
